1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:02,418
(Stuart:)Yeah, it was pretty bad.

2
00:00:03,041 --> 00:00:05,041
(Leonard:)No doubt, no doubt.

3
00:00:07,754 --> 00:00:09,134
(Penny:)Okay, well...

4
00:00:09,297 --> 00:00:12,217
(Leonard:)- ...I'm sorry it didn't work out.
- Not your fault.

5
00:00:12,634 --> 00:00:14,344
(Leonard:)Yeah, how about that?

6
00:00:16,972 --> 00:00:19,762
(Leonard:)- See you soon.
- Yep, sure.

7
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:37,159
Yes, I understand. Classified.
We'll keep it all classified.

8
00:00:37,325 --> 00:00:39,785
No one has to know anything about this
but you and me.

9
00:00:39,953 --> 00:00:41,083
(Penny:)What's classified?

10
00:00:41,413 --> 00:00:44,333
(Leonard:)Howard's space toilet. I'll tell you later.

11
00:00:45,542 --> 00:00:50,212
(Howard:)Well, they've deployed our solution.
Let's just all hope it works.

12
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:52,170
(Sheldon:)I don't see why I have to worry.

13
00:00:52,340 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)My career's not hanging in the balance.

